##Notes##
// Profil OpenPPL d'exemple : "calling station", suit presque tout et relance rarement.

##f$preflop##
WHEN handrank169 <= 5 RaiseTo 4 FORCE
WHEN Raises >= 1 AND handrank169 > 110 Fold FORCE
WHEN Others Call FORCE

##f$flop##
WHEN prwin > 0.85 RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.25 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$turn##
WHEN prwin > 0.88 RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.28 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$river##
WHEN prwin > 0.90 RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.30 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE
